      "content": "it's just nothing. no purpose. like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out because there's no point to anything else. i look at the calendar and every day just looks like a blank wall. i don't think i can do this for another thirty years, or even another month. i just feel so incredibly heavy. like there's no reason to even get up tomorrow.",
